{"id":"u-212c025b-b83b-4e46-b5ef-f3dff377dd4d","src":"community","title":"Two Step 2.0","author":"John O.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/VSuCyX-two-step-20","desc":"Life is not perfect. I can get 1 to 2 cardio sessions done during the week and I weight train back to back days on the weekends. \n\nI feel this is a reasonable two day split covering all muscle groups. \n\nSessions are about 40 minutes.\n\nRest periods are 60 to 90 minutes between sets and 2 minutes between movements. \n\nMy warm up is intuitive. Whatever seems to be jacked up that day, I spend time on. No more than 10 to 15 minutes usually. \n\nIf I have time, I like to put a weight vest on and walk on treadmill at a 3% incline at 3mph for 20 to 30 minutes as a finisher.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":40,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:14:00.713Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest/Tris/Quads","Back/Bis/Shoulders/Hams"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Cable Crossover","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Goblet Squat","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Belt Squat","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Glute-Ham Raise","sets":[{"r":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Cable Crossover","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}